{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21035","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21035-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21035-0","text":"丰饶命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21035-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21035-1","text":"「倘若所有的钟表都在指示错误的时刻……」\n「倘若许下承诺的人以背誓完成诺言……」\n「倘若沉入幻梦之人从未真正睡着……」\n「倘若死者活着归来，发现姓名已被剥夺……」\n\n「倘若…倘若……」\n他吹灭火焰，黑暗中只余时钟永不停歇地滴答作响。","speaker":""}]}
